b_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054950/extras/b5b47cc6e0652fdabb36ea5e67aadcae.poster.avif?t=1755200501\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054950/extras/b5b47cc6e0652fdabb36ea5e67aadcae.webm?t=1755200501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054950/extras/e6e901f64a49d9c31f64331dc196f11d.avif?t=1755200501\" data-has-big width=800 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is  co-funded by the MEDIA strand of the European Union\u2019s Creative Europe Programme.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054950/extras/5cf520f50b0968a580a59a5f0cb2b2bd.avif?t=1755200501\" data-has-big width=800 height=191 /></span></p>",
